# Build artifacts
**/bin/
**/obj/
publish/

# IDE
.vs/
.idea/
*.user

# OS
.DS_Store

# Locally-trusted certs (e.g. a corporate TLS-inspecting proxy's root CA) go here — ignored by
# default so a *different* org's cert never gets committed by accident. zscaler-root-ca.pem is
# explicitly tracked below: see certs/README.md for why that one's safe to commit.
certs/*.pem
certs/*.crt
!certs/zscaler-root-ca.pem
